OL,3,CFamily pay tribute to artist who died
OL,4,Cfollowing Shaldon collision
OL,6,FThe family of a woman who died
OL,7,Ffollowing a fatal collision in Shaldon
OL,8,Fhave paid tribute to an artist whose
OL,9,Fbright paintings reflected her
OL,10,F"strong, bright, intuitive and warm"
OL,11,Fpersonality.
OL,13,FOfficers were called to the A379
OL,14,FTorquay Road in Shaldon, on Friday 3
OL,15,FJuly, at around 1.20pm, following a
OL,16,Freport of a road traffic collision
OL,17,Finvolving a silver-coloured motorcycle
OL,18,Fand a pedestrian.
OL,26,@rD@AOUrD@dO]
