OL,3,CFamily pay tribute to artist who died
OL,4,Cfollowing Shaldon collision
OL,6,FPolice enquiries remain ongoing into
OL,7,Fthe circumstances of the collision.
OL,8,FThey have urged anyone who may have
OL,9,Fwitnessed the collision or has
OL,10,Frelevant dash-cam, to contact Devon &
OL,11,FCornwall Police on 101 or via their
OL,12,Fwebsite by quoting reference number
OL,13,F50260172663.
